{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118808","id":3561306756,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7URTqE","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118808","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118808.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118808.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118808","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118808/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118808/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118808/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/489b9100d85b1cf0e416b78b8761910c1320a220","number":118808,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[GDScript] Optimize multi-threaded debug calls","user":{"login":"NoctemCat","id":22471296,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDcxMjk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22471296?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat","html_url":"https://github.com/NoctemCat","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Original PR: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118507\r\n\r\nSlightly improves debug calls multi-threading performance by itself, but with lock-free `ObjectDB::get_instance` https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118803 the speed actually becomes pretty nice.\r\n\r\n## Technical overview\r\nOnly calls debug `get_validated_object` if it is needed. This means that when function returns `null` value or in profiling the speed will be the same as in master, but in all other cases this PR improves debug call speed.\r\n\r\nThe additional speed also comes from removing `StringName` ternary.\r\n\r\n## Performace testing\r\nBuild commands are the same as in the original PR.\r\nTest project: [testthreads4.6_target.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26926113/testthreads4.6_target.zip)\r\n\r\nThe basic test was to divide the iterations between threads and to perform the most basic interaction inside the loop, in theory this should imitate doing parallelizable work. The number of iterations was 200_000_000.\r\n\r\nThe results are presented as tables. In the columns was written the number of threads this attempt used, 0th thread is main thread that serves as the control.\r\nColumn type:\r\n- `debug` - tested it in launched from Godot project\r\n- `tool` - tested it inside tool script in editor\r\n- `release` - tested it in export release\r\n\r\nTested on:\r\n- EndeavourOS on X11 \r\n- X11 display driver, Multi-window, 2 monitors \r\n- Vulkan (Forward+) \r\n- dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1650 (nvidia; 595.58.03) \r\n- Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-9300H CPU @ 2.40GHz (8 threads) \r\n- 15.49 GiB memory\r\n\r\nIncludes additional cases with lock-free `ObjectDB::get_instance`, separately and on top of the current changes. \r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>func_base, this one is fine, control</summary>\r\nSetting values directly on the instance fields is also fine\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nfunc func_base(count: int) -> int:\r\n    var time_before: int = Time.get_ticks_msec()\r\n    var sum := 0\r\n    for i in count:\r\n        sum += 1\r\n    finished.emit.call_deferred(Time.get_ticks_msec() - time_before)\r\n    return sum\r\n```\r\n\r\nfunc_base\r\n| Type    | Branch               |     0 |     1 |     2 |     3 |     4 |     5 |     6 |     7 |     8 |\r\n| ------- | -------------------- | ----: | ----: | ----: | ----: | ----: | ----: | ----: | ----: | ----: |\r\n| debug   | master               |  4022 |  4720 |  4214 |  3639 |  3602 |  3768 |  2999 |  2409 |  2896 |\r\n| debug   | debug_call           |  3958 |  4425 |  3652 |  3877 |  4007 |  3907 |  3445 |  2643 |  2720 |\r\n| debug   | lock_free            |  3945 |  4680 |  3686 |  3873 |  4027 |  3678 |  2823 |  2535 |  2251 |\r\n| debug   | debug_call.lock_free |  4134 |  4507 |  3593 |  4002 |  4024 |  3390 |  3338 |  2497 |  2365 |\r\n| tool    | master               |  3900 |  3626 |  1957 |  1492 |  1141 |  1219 |  1141 |  1079 |  1030 |\r\n| tool    | debug_call           |  3424 |  3469 |  1931 |  1413 |  1083 |  1140 |  1013 |  1074 |   934 |\r\n| tool    | lock_free            |  3450 |  3587 |  1766 |  1286 |  1155 |  1184 |  1043 |  1109 |  1036 |\r\n| tool    | debug_call.lock_free |  3454 |  3482 |  1932 |  1472 |  1044 |  1320 |  1129 |  1158 |  1123 |\r\n| release | master               |  2539 |  3034 |  1445 |  1083 |  1221 |  1130 |  1063 |   805 |   694 |\r\n| release | debug_call           |  2506 |  2994 |  2073 |  1696 |  1340 |   994 |   826 |   964 |  1092 |\r\n| release | lock_free            |  2515 |  2752 |  1571 |  1088 |   854 |   895 |   739 |   843 |   780 |\r\n| release | debug_call.lock_free |  2474 |  2544 |  1467 |  1163 |  1075 |   948 |   791 |   994 |   672 |\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>call_base, debug</summary>\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nfunc call_base(count: int) -> int:\r\n    var time_before: int = Time.get_ticks_msec()\r\n    var sum := 0\r\n    for i in count:\r\n        sum += get_instance_increment()\r\n    finished.emit.call_deferred(Time.get_ticks_msec() - time_before)\r\n    return sum\r\n\r\nfunc get_instance_increment() -> int:\r\n    return 1\r\n```\r\n\r\ncall_base\r\n| Type    | Branch               |     0 |     1 |     2 |     3 |     4 |     5 |     6 |     7 |     8 |\r\n| ------- | -------------------- | ----: | ----: | ----: | ----: | ----: | ----: | ----: | ----: | ----: |\r\n| debug   | master               | 23246 | 26196 | 44432 | 55803 | 68177 | 66780 | 67295 | 70581 | 78727 |\r\n| debug   | debug_call           | 20406 | 22399 | 30405 | 34066 | 43399 | 42855 | 44025 | 45362 | 50152 |\r\n| debug   | lock_free            | 20942 | 24560 | 24137 | 20521 | 21446 | 20577 | 20475 | 20194 | 19630 |\r\n| debug   | debug_call.lock_free | 19364 | 22670 | 16924 | 13504 | 12840 | 12375 | 11636 | 10015 |  9541 |\r\n| tool    | master               | 20625 | 21119 | 31308 | 36121 | 45036 | 44400 | 42545 | 45128 | 50694 |\r\n| tool    | debug_call           | 17908 | 17883 | 15344 | 15570 | 20454 | 21708 | 21551 | 22308 | 23980 |\r\n| tool    | lock_free            | 19487 | 19792 | 13048 | 17304 | 19066 | 18241 | 18792 | 19157 | 19447 |\r\n| tool    | debug_call.lock_free | 17121 | 17267 |  9301 |  6448 |  5197 |  6224 |  5872 |  5522 |  5604 |\r\n| release | master               | 11913 | 13418 |  7459 |  5222 |  5260 |  5070 |  4280 |  4771 |  3822 |\r\n| release | debug_call           | 11767 | 13863 |  7484 |  6289 |  5476 |  5678 |  5138 |  4989 |  4801 |\r\n| release | lock_free            | 12967 | 13279 |  7375 |  5859 |  5349 |  5017 |  5003 |  4709 |  4111 |\r\n| release | debug_call.lock_free | 12891 | 13560 |  8046 |  6270 |  5664 |  5502 |  5120 |  4850 |  4730 |\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>func_call_null, debug</summary>\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nfunc func_call_null(count: int) -> int:\r\n    var time_before: int = Time.get_ticks_msec()\r\n    var temp: Variant = true\r\n    for i in count:\r\n        temp = get_null()\r\n    finished.emit.call_deferred(Time.get_ticks_msec() - time_before)\r\n    return 0 if temp == null else 1\r\n\r\nfunc get_null() -> Variant:\r\n    return null\r\n```\r\n\r\ncall_base\r\n| Type    | Branch               |     0 |     1 |     2 |     3 |     4 |     5 |     6 |     7 |     8 |\r\n| ------- | -------------------- | ----: | ----: | ----: | ----: | ----: | ----: | ----: | ----: | ----: |\r\n| debug   | master               | 26483 | 28864 | 46087 | 55530 | 67868 | 68346 | 67556 | 71595 | 79821 |\r\n| debug   | debug_call           | 25225 | 27623 | 41995 | 52279 | 66689 | 66371 | 64056 | 68234 | 75604 |\r\n| debug   | lock_free            | 24602 | 26493 | 30076 | 29462 | 31405 | 29048 | 29057 | 27380 | 27067 |\r\n| debug   | debug_call.lock_free | 23543 | 25756 | 21765 | 20184 | 20904 | 21501 | 21777 | 21959 | 22118 |\r\n| tool    | master               | 25548 | 25240 | 35357 | 37100 | 42411 | 40962 | 45753 | 47468 | 52317 |\r\n| tool    | debug_call           | 22182 | 23387 | 21486 | 31487 | 42418 | 43144 | 41528 | 44362 | 47550 |\r\n| tool    | lock_free            | 22957 | 23806 | 26102 | 25816 | 25941 | 25036 | 24036 | 22934 | 22407 |\r\n| tool    | debug_call.lock_free | 21494 | 22519 | 15189 | 17712 | 19603 | 19280 | 19376 | 19432 | 19523 |\r\n| release | master               | 10733 | 12339 |  6454 |  4653 |  4565 |  4625 |  4648 |  4375 |  3712 |\r\n| release | debug_call           | 10912 | 11736 |  7337 |  5602 |  5042 |  5036 |  4553 |  3812 |  4392 |\r\n| release | lock_free            | 10667 | 12291 |  6392 |  5076 |  4818 |  4973 |  4651 |  4196 |  3809 |\r\n| release | debug_call.lock_free | 11010 | 12525 |  6387 |  5115 |  4215 |  5192 |  4068 |  4463 |  4342 |\r\n</details>\r\n\r\nRaw results:\r\n[results_raw.txt](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26926335/results_raw.txt)\r\n[results_grouped.txt](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26926339/results_grouped.txt)","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement"